#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:5
#: 1e4a1f405d2f44f3a90bf9a68dc28b68
msgid "Archived: Object Avoidance"
msgstr "已归档：避障"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:7
#: 925313443ec647dc972678589720c369
msgid ""
"Rover supports two forms of object avoidance which can be enabled separately"
" or simultaneously"
msgstr "Rover 支持两种避障方式，可单独或同时启用"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:9
#: 1a0fb8ef4ac94dfdbbaf9a1089b6e202
msgid ""
"\"dodge\" avoidance attempts to steer around obstacles in :ref:`Steering "
"<steering-mode>`, :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`, :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`, "
":ref:`Guided <guided-mode>` and :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` modes"
msgstr ""
"「闪避」避障尝试在 :ref:`Steering <steering-mode>`、:ref:`RTL <rtl-"
"mode>`、:ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`、:ref:`Guided <guided-mode>` 和 "
":ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` 模式下绕开障碍物"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:10
#: cf819cc82e654838a50cbd4bb12f3d2d
msgid ""
"\"simple\" object avoidance attempts to stop the vehicle before it hits "
"objects in :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>`, :ref:`Steering <steering-mode>`, "
":ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` and :ref:`Guided <guided-mode>` modes"
msgstr ""
"「简单」避障尝试在 :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>`、:ref:`Steering <steering-"
"mode>`、:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`Guided <guided-mode>` "
"模式下在撞上障碍物之前停车"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:13
#: b3cbe92297f84cf384f52bf8eccd3ee7
msgid "\"Dodge\" Avoidance"
msgstr "「闪避」避障"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:21
#: f29a388cd85843a894d9e36867104fb7
msgid ""
"Dodge only works with forward facing range finders (sonar/lidar).  360 "
"degree lidar cannot be used for this method of avoidance"
msgstr "闪避仅适用于前向测距仪（声呐/激光雷达）。360 度激光雷达不能用于此避障方式"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:23
#: b5cf068be6874699b012a8ac25ed0c18
msgid ""
"One or two range finders should be mounted facing forward as described on "
"the :ref:`range finder wiki pages <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`"
msgstr ""
"应按照 :ref:`测距仪 Wiki 页面 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` 所述，安装一个或两个前向测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:24
#: 13c14c8b31234dcc8e9baae5ca198a85
msgid ""
"RNGFND_TRIGGR_CM specifies the distance in cm at which the vehicle will "
"begin turning.  I.e. 100 will mean the vehicle will begin turning 1m from "
"the object. Set this value to 0 if you want the vehicle to stop instead of "
"going around the obstacle."
msgstr ""
"RNGFND_TRIGGR_CM 指定车辆开始转向的距离（单位：cm）。例如，100 表示车辆将在距障碍物 1m "
"处开始转向。若希望车辆停车而非绕行障碍物，请将此值设为 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:25
#: 4511bba2d9d746c9bd9dfdeaab24706e
msgid ""
"RNGFND_TURN_ANGL controls the direction and aggressiveness of the turn.  "
"Large positive or negative values (i.e. -450 or 450) cause turns up to the "
"vehicle's maximum lateral acceleration (i.e. :ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G "
"<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>`) while values near zero cause gentle turns.  Negative "
"values cause the vehicle to turn left, positive causes a turn right."
msgstr ""
"RNGFND_TURN_ANGL 控制转向方向和转向力度。较大的正值或负值（如 -450 或 450）会使车辆以最大横向加速度（即 "
":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G <ATC_TURN_MAX_G>`）转向，接近零的值则产生轻柔转向。负值使车辆向左转，正值使车辆向右转。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:26
#: 464fbd900b1346b8baa8bab01c2634e9
msgid ""
"RNGFND_TURN_TIME controls how many seconds the vehicle will continue turning"
" after the object has gone out of view."
msgstr "RNGFND_TURN_TIME 控制障碍物消失视野后车辆继续转向的秒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:27
#: 98a99fc7d4c1426abe20881809c17e88
msgid ""
"RNGFND_DEBOUNCE specifies how many consecutive readings are required to "
"trigger the turn response.  A higher number reduces false positives but also"
" adds a small lag in the response."
msgstr "RNGFND_DEBOUNCE 指定触发转向响应所需的连续读数次数。数值越大误报越少，但响应延迟也会略有增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:29
#: 740a11847faa4e959334b2d9fd1852b1
msgid ""
"This \"dodge\" method of avoidance can only be activated in :ref:`Steering "
"<steering-mode>`, :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`, :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`, "
":ref:`Guided <guided-mode>` and :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` modes."
msgstr ""
"此「闪避」避障方式只能在 :ref:`Steering <steering-mode>`、:ref:`RTL <rtl-"
"mode>`、:ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`、:ref:`Guided <guided-mode>` 和 "
":ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` 模式下激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:32
#: 38f8c0342eb24898a77602b53349e9ad
msgid "Simple Avoidance (Stopping)"
msgstr "简单避障（停车）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:37
#: e6eea06405fc493692db05f6ff06981c
msgid ""
"This form of avoidance attempts to stop the vehicle before hitting objects."
msgstr "此避障方式尝试在撞上障碍物之前停车。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:39
#: 209c39f646e44f1bb7973caf2c5af05f
msgid ""
"follow the normal :ref:`instructions for setting up rangefinders <common-"
"rangefinder-landingpage>`"
msgstr "按照 :ref:`测距仪设置说明 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` 进行正常配置"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:40
#: efc92eafe32e4b4d900286efe76162ea
msgid "if using regular lidar or sonar (i.e. not 360 degree lidar):"
msgstr "若使用普通激光雷达或声呐（非 360 度激光雷达）："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:43
#: 41212eb2fc6f41d0887993e73ea2d90a
msgid ""
"set ``RNGFNDx_ORIENT`` (for example :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` ) "
"to \"0\" for forward facing lidar and \"4\" for backwards facing lidar"
msgstr ""
"将 ``RNGFNDx_ORIENT`` （例如 "
":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>`）设为「0」表示前向激光雷达，「4」表示后向激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:44
#: 6a313defa6ac43dd86a185a8c6ab79b7
msgid ""
"set ``PRX_TYPE`` = \"4\" to enable using range finders as \"proximity "
"sensors\""
msgstr "将 ``PRX_TYPE`` 设为「4」以启用将测距仪作为「近距传感器」使用"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:45
#: 7e43f94f4a594df685ee57d50be3cb3f
msgid ""
"set :ref:`AVOID_ENABLE <AVOID_ENABLE>` to \"7\" to enable avoidance using "
"proximity sensors (and fences)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`AVOID_ENABLE <AVOID_ENABLE>` 设为「7」以启用基于近距传感器（和围栏）的避障"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-object-avoidance.rst:48
#: 707b026187fa4971bed2e9d4ffac0be4
msgid ""
"This \"simple\" method of avoidance can only be activated in :ref:`Acro "
"<acro-mode>`, :ref:`Steering <steering-mode>`, :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` "
"and :ref:`Guided <guided-mode>` modes."
msgstr ""
"此「简单」避障方式只能在 :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>`、:ref:`Steering <steering-"
"mode>`、:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`Guided <guided-mode>` 模式下激活。"
